# Allowlist: only what the image build needs is sent to Docker.
*
!apps/
!packages/
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!turbo.json
# The browser-test workspace is in the lockfile, so its manifest must be
# here for a frozen install; its tests never are.
!e2e/package.json

# Build output and dependencies are always recreated inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
